  "onbStep1Title": "Open OBS on your computer",
  "onbStep1Body": "Use OBS Studio version 28 or newer. It already includes everything OBS Pad needs — nothing else to install on the PC.",
  "onbStep1Hint": "Not sure about the version? In OBS, click Help > About.",
